<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Jan 30-Feb 5:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 55.76</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 59.38</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 61.06</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 64.12</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$155.33</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$116.50</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 82.54</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 19.29</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  1.93</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 21.52</p>
</text>
